{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_19", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_19.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "STOCKMANN", "names": ["STOCKMANN"], "gender": "?", "first": 2, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Well then I must say it is absolutely unjustifiable of Dr. Stockmann\u2014I beg your pardon, Mr. Mayor.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "What you say is lamentably true, Mr. Aslaksen.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "My brother has unfortunately always been a headstrong man.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "After this, do you mean to give him your support, Mr. Hovstad?", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Can you suppose for a moment that I\u2014?", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "I have drawn up a short resume of the situation as it appears from a reasonable man's point of view.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "In it I have indicated how certain possible defects might suitably be remedied without outrunning the resources of the Baths Committee.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you got it with you, Mr. Mayor?", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (fumbling in his pocket).", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I brought it with me in case you should\u2014", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Good Lord, there he is!", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Who?", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "My brother?", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Where?", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Where?", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "He has just gone through the printing room.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "How unlucky!", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't want to meet him here, and I had still several things to speak to you about.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (pointing to the door on the right).", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Go in there for the present.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "But\u2014?", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "You will only find Billing in there.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Quick, quick, Mr. Mayor\u2014he is just coming.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, very well; but see that you get rid of him quickly.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes out through the door on the right, which ASLAKSEN opens for him and shuts after him.)", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Pretend to be doing something, Aslaksen.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "(Sits down and writes.", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "ASLAKSEN begins foraging among a heap of newspapers that are lying on a chair.)", "para": 17, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (coming in from the printing room).", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Here I am again.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "(Puts down his hat and stick.)", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (writing).", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Already, Doctor?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Hurry up with what we were speaking about, Aslaksen.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "We are very pressed for time today.", "para": 19, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (to ASLAKSEN).", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "No proof for me to see yet, I hear.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (without turning round).", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "You couldn't expect it yet, Doctor.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "No, no; but I am impatient, as you can understand.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "I shall not know a moment's peace of mind until I see it in print.", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!\u2014It will take a good while yet, won't it, Aslaksen?", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I am almost afraid it will.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "All right, my dear friends; I will come back.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "I do not mind coming back twice if necessary.", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "A matter of such great importance\u2014the welfare of the town at stake\u2014it is no time to shirk trouble, (is just going, but stops and comes back.)", "para": 25, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Look here\u2014there is one thing more I want to speak to you about.", "para": 25, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Excuse me, but could it not wait till some other time?", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "I can tell you in half a dozen words.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "It is only this.", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "When my article is read tomorrow and it is realised that I have been quietly working the whole winter for the welfare of the town\u2014", "para": 27, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes but, Doctor\u2014", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "I know what you are going to say.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "You don't see how on earth it was any more than my duty\u2014my obvious duty as a citizen.", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course it wasn't; I know that as well as you.", "para": 29, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "But my fellow citizens, you know\u2014!", "para": 29, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Good Lord, think of all the good souls who think so highly of me\u2014!", "para": 29, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, our townsfolk have had a very high opinion of you so far, Doctor.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, and that is just why I am afraid they\u2014.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, this is the point; when this reaches them, especially the poorer classes, and sounds in their ears like a summons to take the town's affairs into their own hands for the future...", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (getting up).", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Ahem!", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Doctor, I won't conceal from you the fact\u2014", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah I\u2014I knew there was something in the wind!", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "But I won't hear a word of it.", "para": 33, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "If anything of that sort is being set on foot\u2014", "para": 33, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Of what sort?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, whatever it is\u2014whether it is a demonstration in my honour, or a banquet, or a subscription list for some presentation to me\u2014whatever it is, you most promise me solemnly and faithfully to put a stop to it.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "You too, Mr. Aslaksen; do you understand?", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "You must forgive me, Doctor, but sooner or later we must tell you the plain truth\u2014", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "(He is interrupted by the entrance Of MRS. STOCKMANN, who comes in from the street door.)", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (seeing her husband).", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Just as I thought!", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (going towards her).", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "You too, Mrs. Stockmann?", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "What on earth do you want here, Katherine?", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "I should think you know very well what I want.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad, Won't you sit down?", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "Or perhaps\u2014", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "No, thank you; don't trouble.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "And you must not be offended at my coming to fetch my husband; I am the mother of three children, you know.", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Nonsense!\u2014we know all about that.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}]}